<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="ja"><head><metadata><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="1332642606"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1445206399"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="hello, alone"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="Kizuna AI"/><amll:meta key="album" value="Hello, Alone"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="04:06.667"><div begin="00:00.588" end="04:00.090"><p begin="00:00.588" end="00:03.780" itunes:key="L1">Hello, alone 誓おう私<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">Hello alone 我起誓</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">kyoku ： MATZ</span></p><p begin="00:03.780" end="00:06.973" itunes:key="L2">Hello, alone 走り続ける<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">Hello alone 将奔走不息</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Hello alone ha shi ri tsu zu ke ru</span></p><p begin="00:07.983" end="00:11.083" itunes:key="L3">Hello, alone まだ道の途中<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">Hello alone 如今仍在半途</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Hello alone ma da mi chi no to chu u</span></p><p begin="00:11.083" end="00:14.357" itunes:key="L4">How long? 掴めるまで<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">How long 直到抓住梦想</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">How long tsu ka me ru ma de</span></p><p begin="00:17.246" end="00:20.905" itunes:key="L5">待ってたよ きっと来るって<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我等待已久 坚信你定会到来</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ma 't te ta yo ki 't to ku ru 't te</span></p><p begin="00:20.905" end="00:24.202" itunes:key="L6">さっきまで 立っていた場所<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">到达那个直到刚才我还伫立着的地方</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">sa 'k ki ma de ta 't te i ta ba sho</span></p><p begin="00:24.202" end="00:27.465" itunes:key="L7">知ってたよ 次の場所<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我知道 下一个地方应该在哪里</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">shi 't te ta yo tsu gi no ba sho</span></p><p begin="00:27.465" end="00:31.807" itunes:key="L8">ゆずれない あの日見た夢は<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">绝不放弃那日所见的梦想</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">yu zu re na i a no hi mi ta yu me wa</span></p><p begin="00:32.078" end="00:35.093" itunes:key="L9">待ってたよ 君が来るって<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我等待已久 坚信你定会到来</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ma 't te ta yo ki mi ga ku ru 't te</span></p><p begin="00:35.093" end="00:38.285" itunes:key="L10">ずっと前 もっと前から<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">从很早很早以前开始</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">zu 't to ma e mo 't to ma e ka ra</span></p><p begin="00:39.377" end="00:42.662" itunes:key="L11">忘れない 変わらない<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我便念念不忘从不改变</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">wa su re na i ka wa ra na i</span></p><p begin="00:42.662" end="00:45.855" itunes:key="L12">守りたい あの日の思いを<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">想要守护那一日的回忆</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ma mo ri ta i a no hi no o mo i wo</span></p><p begin="00:46.958" end="00:50.151" itunes:key="L13">Hello, alone 誓おう私<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">Hello alone 我起誓</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Hello alone chi ka o u wa ta shi</span></p><p begin="00:50.151" end="00:53.436" itunes:key="L14">Hello, alone 走り続ける<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">Hello alone 将奔走不息</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Hello alone ha shi ri tsu zu ke ru</span></p><p begin="00:54.446" end="00:57.720" itunes:key="L15">Hello, alone まだ道の途中<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">Hello alone 如今仍在半途</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Hello alone ma da mi chi no to chu u</span></p><p begin="00:57.720" end="01:00.994" itunes:key="L16">How long? 掴めるまで<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">How long 直到抓住梦想</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">How long tsu ka me ru ma de</span></p><p begin="01:01.811" end="01:04.176" itunes:key="L17">Hello, alone 誓おう君に<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">Hello alone 我向你起誓</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Hello alone chi ka o u ki mi ni</span></p><p begin="01:05.186" end="01:08.460" itunes:key="L18">Hello, alone 走り続けよう<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">Hello alone 将奔走不息</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Hello alone ha shi ri tsu zu ke yo u</span></p><p begin="01:08.460" end="01:11.745" itunes:key="L19">Hello, alone まだ道の途中<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">Hello alone 如今仍在未知的半途</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Hello alone ma da mi chi no to chu u</span></p><p begin="01:12.755" end="01:16.029" itunes:key="L20">How long? つながるまで<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">How long 直到与你相连</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">How long tsu na ga ru ma de</span></p><p begin="01:45.959" end="01:49.153" itunes:key="L21">待ってるよ きっと来るって<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我一直在等待 坚信你定会到来</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ma 't te ru yo ki 't to ku ru 't te</span></p><p begin="01:49.153" end="01:52.438" itunes:key="L22">さっきまで 立っていた場所<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">到达那个直到刚才我还伫立着的地方</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">sa 'k ki ma de ta 't te i ta ba sho</span></p><p begin="01:52.438" end="01:55.654" itunes:key="L23">知ってるよ 次の場所<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我知道的，下一个地点 绝不动摇的，那天的梦想</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">shi 't te ru yo tsu gi no ba sho</span></p><p begin="01:56.687" end="01:59.961" itunes:key="L24">ゆずれない あの日見た夢は<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">绝不放弃那日所见的梦想</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">yu zu re na i a no hi mi ta yu me wa</span></p><p begin="01:59.961" end="02:03.236" itunes:key="L25">待ってるよ 君が来るって<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我一直在等待 坚信你定会到来</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ma 't te ru yo ki mi ga ku ru 't te</span></p><p begin="02:04.327" end="02:07.612" itunes:key="L26">ずっと先 もっと未来で<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">从很早以前到更久远的未来</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">zu 't to sa ki mo 't to mi ra i de</span></p><p begin="02:07.612" end="02:10.910" itunes:key="L27">忘れない 変わらない<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我便念念不忘从不改变</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">wa su re na i ka wa ra na i</span></p><p begin="02:10.910" end="02:15.205" itunes:key="L28">守り抜く あの日の思いを<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我将坚守那一日的回忆</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ma mo ri nu ku a no hi no o mo i wo</span></p><p begin="02:15.205" end="02:18.398" itunes:key="L29">Hello, hello, hello, how long?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">Hello，Hello，Hello，How long?</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Hello hello hello how long</span></p><p begin="02:19.408" end="02:22.694" itunes:key="L30">Hello, hello, 目覚めたら<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">Hello hello 若是苏醒</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Hello hello me za me ta ra</span></p><p begin="02:22.694" end="02:25.956" itunes:key="L31">Hello, hello, hello, again<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">Hello，Hello，Hello，again</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Hello hello hello again</span></p><p begin="02:25.956" end="02:30.368" itunes:key="L32">もう迷いはしないから<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我便不再迷茫</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mo u ma yo i wa shi na i ka ra</span></p><p begin="02:30.368" end="02:33.665" itunes:key="L33">Hello, alone 誓おう私<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">Hello alone 我起誓</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Hello alone chi ka o u wa ta shi</span></p><p begin="02:33.665" end="02:36.858" itunes:key="L34">Hello, alone 走り続ける<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">Hello alone 将奔走不息</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Hello alone ha shi ri tsu zu ke ru</span></p><p begin="02:37.961" end="02:41.247" itunes:key="L35">Hello, alone まだ道の途中<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">Hello alone 如今仍在半途</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Hello alone ma da mi chi no to chu u</span></p><p begin="02:41.247" end="02:44.544" itunes:key="L36">How long? 掴めるまで<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">How long 直到抓住梦想</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">How long tsu ka me ru ma de</span></p><p begin="02:45.542" end="02:47.725" itunes:key="L37">Hello, alone 誓おう君に<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">Hello alone 我向你起誓</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Hello alone chi ka o u ki mi ni</span></p><p begin="02:48.723" end="02:52.021" itunes:key="L38">Hello, alone 走り続けよう<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">Hello alone 将奔走不息</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Hello alone ha shi ri tsu zu ke yo u</span></p><p begin="02:52.021" end="02:55.295" itunes:key="L39">Hello, alone まだ道の途中<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">Hello alone 如今仍在未知的半途</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Hello alone ma da mi chi no to chu u</span></p><p begin="02:56.386" end="02:58.580" itunes:key="L40">How long? つなげるまで<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">How long 直到与你相连</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">How long tsu na ge ru ma de</span></p><p begin="03:46.076" end="03:49.339" itunes:key="L41">Hello, alone 誓おうここで<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">Hello alone 我在此起誓</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Hello alone chi ka o u ko ko de</span></p><p begin="03:49.339" end="03:52.613" itunes:key="L42">Hello, alone 走り続ける<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">Hello alone 将奔走不息</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Hello alone ha shi ri tsu zu ke ru</span></p><p begin="03:53.623" end="03:56.897" itunes:key="L43">Hello, alone まだ夢の途中<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">Hello alone 如今仍在梦的半途</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Hello alone ma da yu me no to chu u</span></p><p begin="03:56.897" end="04:00.090" itunes:key="L44">歌い続けてゆく<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我将歌唱不息</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">u ta i tsu zu ke te yu ku</span></p></div></body></tt>